# A session killed with unsaved work leaves a recovery copy beside the document; the next start asks, and Recover opens the copy under the document's name, marked modified.
@recovery
@file "C:\\DOCS\\LETTER.QLD" "dear sir"
cmd Open
choose "C:\\DOCS\\LETTER.QLD"
type ", and madam"
@clock +300s
autosave
dump
restart
expect recover "Quill found changes to LETTER.QLD that were not saved, from 25 Nov 2026 at 2:37 PM." default Yes
answer recover
dump
